{
  "_comment": [
    "Default fixture fragment merged under every eqgfx_dx7.dll fixture (tests/unicorn/eqgfx/...; conftest.py picks it by the",
    "fixture's folder). eqgfx_dx7.dll's VC6 SP4 LIBCMT functions (CRT block 0x10067942-0x10075A66, FID names in the export) run",
    "natively on each side (passthrough), keyed by eqgfx's VA; rewrite_aliases map the test DLL's own CRT symbols to the same keys.",
    "strcpy is the 7-byte entry 0x10 before strcat (jmp into strcat's body); memcpy/memmove are two identical copies (0x100679F0 with",
    "20 callers = memmove, 0x10067D30 with 116 = memcpy). _chkstk is __alloca_probe. __ftol is the conversion helper at 0x1004EC36;",
    "some renderer objects use inline fistp (check CFLAGS for /QIfist). There is no isdigit/isspace/isalpha/isprint (the",
    "ctype macros are inlined). test_crt_defaults.py checks each alias against eqgfx's code at its VA. Same merge rules as crt_defaults.json."
  ],
